WEBVTT

NOTE Draft captions for listening review.

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:21.660
The hands that shaped the heavens
And scattered every star

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:26.280
Reached into this broken world
And met us where we are

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:30.660
They touched the ones forgotten
The ones no one would see

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:35.660
The hands that made creation
Reached down and made them clean

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:44.420
Power enough to form the world
Tender enough to touch

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:48.240
The hands that held the nails
Are the hands that hold me now

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:52.580
The hands that bore the scars
Will never let me down

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:57.000
The hands that healed the broken
Still reach for me somehow

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:04.920
The hands that held the nails
Are the hands that hold me now

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:20.940
They took a child by the hand

00:01:20.940 --> 00:01:25.280
And called her back to life
They broke the bread for thousands

00:01:25.280 --> 00:01:29.640
They served throughout the night
They washed the feet of sinners

00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:33.760
Though heaven shouts His name
The hands that ruled creation

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:41.160
Chose a towel over fame
Strong enough to conquer death

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:46.740
Humble enough to serve
The hands that held the nails

00:01:46.740 --> 00:01:51.060
Are the hands that hold me now
The hands that bore the scars

00:01:51.060 --> 00:01:55.320
Will never let me down
The hands that healed the broken

00:01:55.320 --> 00:01:59.660
Still reach for me somehow
The hands that held the nails

00:01:59.660 --> 00:02:05.660
Are the hands that hold me now

00:02:18.500 --> 00:02:23.620
The hands that blessed the broken
Were wounded for my sin

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:27.960
The hands that gave out mercy
Were opened once again

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:32.140
And when the grave stood empty
The scars still told the story

00:02:32.140 --> 00:02:36.500
The hands that death could not hold down
Were lifted up in glory

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:45.140
The wounds were still upon His hands
But death had lost its claim

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:49.360
The hands that held the nails
Are the hands that hold me now

00:02:49.360 --> 00:02:53.620
The hands that bore the scars
Will never let me down

00:02:53.620 --> 00:02:57.860
The hands that healed the broken
Still reach for me somehow

00:02:57.860 --> 00:03:06.540
The hands that held the nails
Are the hands that hold me now

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:14.320
The hands that held the nails
Are the hands that hold me now

00:03:18.220 --> 00:03:22.440
When I am afraid
You hold me

00:03:22.440 --> 00:03:26.620
When I lose my way
You guide me

00:03:26.620 --> 00:03:31.140
When I cannot stand
You carry me

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:37.140
No one can take me
From Your hand

00:03:37.140 --> 00:03:41.300
You hold me
(You hold me)

00:03:41.300 --> 00:03:45.520
You keep me
(You keep me)

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:49.120
Scarred hands
Still reaching

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:52.880
Grace and mercy
still revealing

00:03:52.880 --> 00:03:57.180
The hands that held the nails
Are the hands that hold me now

00:03:57.180 --> 00:04:01.340
The hands that bore the scars
Will never let me down

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:05.560
The hands that healed the broken
Still reach for me somehow

00:04:05.560 --> 00:04:13.940
The hands that held the nails
Are the hands that hold me now

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:21.740
The hands that held the nails
Are the hands that hold me now

00:04:26.400 --> 00:04:30.760
The hands that shaped the heavens
The hands that raised the dead

00:04:30.760 --> 00:04:35.120
They washed the feet of men;
Were wounded in my stead

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:39.380
And nothing in creation
Can take me from them now

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:48.480
The hands that held the nails
Are the hands that hold me now

00:04:48.480 --> 00:04:57.060
The hands that held the nails
Still hold me now
